### 纠正错误
1. High-Rail → High-speed rail（固定表达）
2. a important → an important（important 元音音素开头）
3. achivement → achievement（拼写错误）
4. chinese → Chinese（表示国家相关词汇首字母大写）
5. modern building → modernization（现代化建设，building 多指建筑物）
6. By developing many years → After years of development（表达逻辑错误）
7. high speech rail → high-speed rail（speech 是演讲，speed 才是速度，拼写错误）
8. fast on speech, high on security → high speed and high safety（搭配不当）
9. walk time → travel time（出行时间，walk time 仅指步行时间）
10. outset economically → business trips（商务出行，原表达不存在）
11. spreaded → spread（spread 过去分词形式不变）
12. country card → national name card（国家名片固定搭配）


###美化
High-speed rail is an important achievement of Chinese modernization. After years of development, China has built the world's largest high-speed rail network. High-speed rail
has high speed and great safety, greatly reducing travel time between cities and making it convenient for people to visit relatives, travel and go on business trips. At present,
Chinese high-speed rail technology has spread abroad, becoming a shining national name card.


